.992" end="00:52.542">I </span><span begin="00:52.542" end="00:52.853">can </span><span begin="00:52.853" end="00:53.106">be </span><span begin="00:53.106" end="00:53.666">cool </span><span begin="00:53.666" end="00:53.854">（If </span><span begin="00:53.854" end="00:54.106">you </span><span begin="00:54.106" end="00:54.352">just </span><span begin="00:54.352" end="00:54.605">wanna </span><span begin="00:54.605" end="00:54.915">be </span><span begin="00:54.915" end="00:55.225">mad）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.029" end="01:00.015"><span begin="00:56.029" end="00:56.577">I </span><span begin="00:56.577" end="00:56.893">can </span><span begin="00:56.893" end="00:57.203">be </span><span begin="00:57.203" end="00:58.329">anything  </span><span begin="00:58.329" end="00:58.643">I'll </span><span begin="00:58.643" end="00:58.893">be </span><span begin="00:58.893" end="00:59.139">your </span><span begin="00:59.139" end="01:00.007">everything</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.151" end="01:04.327"><span begin="01:00.151" end="01:00.641">Just </span><span begin="01:00.641" end="01:00.889">touch </span><span begin="01:00.889" end="01:01.139">me </span><span begin="01:01.139" end="01:01.953">baby </span><span begin="01:01.953" end="01:02.141">（I </span><span begin="01:02.141" end="01:02.397">don't </span><span begin="01:02.397" end="01:02.639">wanna </span><span begin="01:02.639" end="01:02.953">be </span><span begin="01:02.953" end="01:03.203">sad）</span><span begin="01:04.313" end="01:05.433"> </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.864" end="01:08.729"><span begin="01:04.864" end="01:05.289">As </span><span begin="01:05.289" end="01:05.414">long </span><span begin="01:05.414" end="01:05.602">as </span><span begin="01:05.602" end="01:05.727">I'm </span><span begin="01:05.727" end="01:06.102">your </span><span begin="01:06.102" end="01:07.375">hooker </span><span begin="01:07.375" end="01:07.541">（Back </span><span begin="01:07.541" end="01:07.665">up </spa