:23.590" end="01:23.778">（Yeah  </span><span begin="01:23.778" end="01:24.026">you're </span><span begin="01:24.026" end="01:24.402">my </span><span begin="01:24.402" end="01:25.147">hooker）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.106" end="01:29.026"><span begin="01:25.106" end="01:27.589">Hooker  </span><span begin="01:27.589" end="01:28.338">（Government </span><span begin="01:28.338" end="01:29.021">Hooker）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.102" end="01:32.902"><span begin="01:29.102" end="01:31.586">Hooker  </span><span begin="01:31.586" end="01:31.774">（Yeah  </span><span begin="01:31.774" end="01:32.088">you're </span><span begin="01:32.088" end="01:32.402">my </span><span begin="01:32.402" end="01:32.897">hooker）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.038" end="01:36.962"><span begin="01:33.038" end="01:35.598">Hooker  </span><span begin="01:35.598" end="01:36.338">（Government </span><span begin="01:36.338" end="01:36.961">Hooker）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.414" end="01:42.086"><span begin="01:38.414" end="01:38.898">I'm </span><span begin="01:38.898" end="01:39.402">gonna </span><span begin="01:39.402" end="01:39.838">drink </span><span begin="01:39.838" end="01:40.282">my </span><span begin="01:40.282" end="01:40.774">tears </span><span begin="01:40.774" end="01:42.080">tonight</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.350" end="01:47.150"><span begin="01:42.350" end="01:42.900">I'm </span><span begin="01:42.900" end="01:43.342">gonna </span><span begin="01:43.342" end="01:43.774">drink </span><span begin="01:43.774" end="01:44.212">my </span><span begin="01:44.212" end="01:44.712">tears </span><span begin="01:44.712" end="01:45.024">and </span><span begin="01:45.024" end="01:46.342">cry</span><span begin="01:47.140" end="01:47.518"> </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.572" end="01:50.376"><span begin="01:46.572" end="01:47.188">Cause </span><span begin="01:47.188" end="01:47.372">I </span><span begin="01:47.372" end="01:47.812"